          "items": [
            "She Sells Seashells<br>Gulf Front One Level Home with Panoramic Views in Seagrove<br><br>Home Introduction<br>Welcome to She Sells Seashells, a comfortable one level Gulf front retreat with panoramic water views and direct private beach access. Just a quick bike ride from Seaside and steps from dining, this pet friendly home offers easy coastal living with comfort, convenience, and unbeatable scenery.<br><br>Home Highlights<br>- Gulf front location with panoramic unobstructed Gulf views<br>- All one level with no stairs to enter or inside the home<br>- Access to 4 Taxi bikes regularly serviced<br>- Two minute bike ride to Seaside food trucks and shopping<br>- Located across from Surfing Deer and two minutes to Publix and local dining<br>- Pet friendly for up to 2 dogs 60 pounds or less with approval from Exclusive 30A and payment of a non-refundable pet fee<br>- Renovated private sundeck with gated stairs to the beach<br>- Outdoor living with dining for 6 Gulf facing loungers outdoor shower and gas grill<br>- Smart TVs throughout the home<br>- Whole home WIFI and cable<br>- Dining table seating for 6 kitchen table seating for 6 and breakfast bar seating for 2<br>- Full kitchen with extra ice maker<br>- Driveway parking for 4 vehicles garage access not available<br><br>Sleeping Arrangements<br>4 Bedrooms 3 Full Baths Sleeps 12<br>- King Suite 1: Gulf views walk in closet dresser storage ensuite bath with walk in shower TV<br>- King Guest Room 2: Gulf views hallway access to shared bath with shower tub combo side entrance to back patio dresser storage TV<br>- King Guest Room 3: Adjacent to shared bath with shower tub combo side entrance to back patio reach in closet dresser storage TV<br>- Bunk Room: Two double over double bunks sleeps 4 ensuite bath with shower tub combo side entrance to back patio seating area with TV and oversized bean bag chairs dresser storage<br>- Bonus: Two twin EZ Beds elevated air beds suitable for use in any room of the home<br><br>Location Perks<br>- Easy walk or bike to Seaside shops restaurants and food trucks<br>- Across from Surfing Deer<br>- Two minutes to Publix The Perfect Pig and Pizza by the Sea<br>- Direct Gulf front location with no need to cross 30A<br><br>Know Before You Go<br>- Pets are not allowed on the beach per county regulations<br>- Mid stay clean required for stays 10 days or longer, and the cost is included in your reservation<br>- Garage access not available<br>- Concierge services available including LSV rental, baby equipment rentals, grocery delivery, and more",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
